<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Every word the blog draws that did not come from an author.

  Post titles, deks and bodies are content and belong to the repository; anything
  in here is chrome — labels, empty states, buttons, the things that stay the same
  whatever is published. The `bl_` prefix follows the same rule as `sl_` in
  :feature:servicelog.

  English throughout, on both sides. The interface is one language; what an author
  publishes is their own choice and arrives as data.
-->
